  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fldtteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/495698685334650903/976914398562103306/nBH_NU_Header.png\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.minecolonies.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://discord.com/api/guilds/139070364159311872/widget.png?style=banner2\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:60px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/495698685334650903/989780094421704714/patreon.png\" width=\"400\" height=\"200\"></a></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px;color:#000080\">這些整合包專為我們舉辦的所有官方特別活動設計。歡迎下載並在單人遊戲中遊玩，或自行架設伺服器與他人同樂。</span><br>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Uj96QH8.png\" width=\"860\" height=\"36\"></p>\n<p>在此回報問題（<strong>請先搜尋</strong>）：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Minecolonies/minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Minecolonies/minecolonies</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>瀏覽我們的維基：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://wiki.minecolonies.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wiki.minecolonies.com/</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在 Patreon 上支持我們：<br><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Minecolonies\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.patreon.com/Minecolonies</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Discord：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.minecolonies.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.minecolonies.com</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>官方網站：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=http://www.minecolonies.com/\" rel=\"nofollow\">http://www.minecolonies.com/</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Minecolonies 在多人遊戲中同樣表現優異。您可以透過合作夥伴 BisectHosting 租用設定簡易的伺服器。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/ldtteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/697517732219846766/727581811151995071/MinecoloniesLogo2Final.png\" alt=\"Bisect 主機\" width=\"524\" height=\"262\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;點擊上方圖片，選擇方案（至少 4GB），並使用我們的代碼&nbsp;<strong>ldtteam</strong>&nbsp;即可獲得首月<strong>25%</strong>折扣，與好友一起暢玩 Minecolonies。</p>",
